Seascape charges a share of your home's net rent, with a lower rate for homes that earn more and a monthly minimum. Patrick quotes your exact fee after looking at your home. That covers listing on Airbnb, Vrbo and our own booking site; setting and adjusting nightly rates as demand moves; screening and messaging guests from Bradenton; coordinating cleaning and maintenance, with a note before you have to ask; and paying you monthly with a statement of what your home earned and spent, with county taxes remitted.
